\f1\fs22 Sarah took the long route\'97via the Traverse concourse where she could grab a golf cart. Sitting on the spartan seat gave her a little more comfort than carrying Little Clinton around on her own legs. But her tailbone bore much of her weight, and it stung like it had been bitten.\
